# Shell scripts must check out with LF even on Windows. A CRLF shebang makes
# Linux report `bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M`, which surfaces as the same
# misleading "not found" at container boot that CF-170 was — and this repo is
# worked on from Windows, so without this the line endings depend on whoever
# happens to commit the file.
*.sh text eol=lf
.hooks/* text eol=lf
